CORE
Unwind
--function Unwind.arithmetic --unwind 3 --max-nondet-string-length 60 -cp `../../../../scripts/format_classpath.sh . ../../../lib/java-models-library/target/core-models.jar ../../../lib/java-models-library/target/cprover-api.jar`
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
With --unwind 3, the counted loops of the model (over the limbs and bits
of multiply, toString, divide, mod, gcd and sqrt) are unwound fully
whatever --unwind says (see java_library_loop_unwind_handlert).
